{"id": "85890", "name": "משוואה לינארית – פתרון עבור x (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Given</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}} \\]</p><p>then find \\(x\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(x=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> We need to rearrange the equation to make \\(x\\) the subject: move the constant term to the right-hand side, divide by the coefficient of \\(x\\), and check the result by substitution.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Move the constant term</b><br>Start from<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}} \\]</p>[[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]]Subtract \\({{CT:2}}\\) from both sides:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:3}} = {{CT:1}} - {{CT:2}} = {{CT:4}} \\]</p>[[else]]The constant term is \\({{CT:2}}\\), so add \\({{CT:5}}\\) to both sides:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:3}} = {{CT:1}} + {{CT:5}} = {{CT:4}} \\]</p>[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Divide by the coefficient of \\(x\\)</b><br>The coefficient of \\(x\\) is \\({{CT:6}}\\). Dividing both sides by it:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x = \\frac{{{CT:4}}}{{{CT:6}}} = {{CT:7}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Check by substitution</b><br>Substituting \\(x={{CT:7}}\\) into the left-hand side:[[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:6}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:7}}\\right)+{{CT:2}} = {{CT:4}}+{{CT:2}} = {{CT:1}} \\]</p>[[else]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:6}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:7}}\\right)-{{CT:5}} = {{CT:4}}-{{CT:5}} = {{CT:1}} \\]</p>[[/if]]which is the right-hand side. So<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "x_value", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "EQN-LIN-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "EQN-LIN-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "(g+c)/m", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ADD_CONSTANT", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{{CT:1}} + \\left({{CT:2}}\\right)}{{CT:6}}\\mbox{.} \\]</p><p>You have added when you should have subtracted.</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "g/m-c", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "DIVIDE_ONLY_G ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:1}}{{CT:6}} - \\left({{CT:2}}\\right)\\mbox{.} \\]</p><p>You have divided the wrong number.</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "g-c/m", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "DIVIDE_ONLY_C ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}} - \\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:6}}. \\]</p><p>You have divided the wrong number.</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c", "c_magnitude", "c_sign", "g", "linear_lhs", "m", "m_magnitude", "m_sign", "mx_value", "x_value"], "nvariants": 50}